Bea glances up from her magazine. One eyebrow, as usual, doing most of the work.
do GameState.roll_chance(50)
if {check_result}:
	Something she says sticks with you. You file it away for later.
	if {stats.perception} < 10:
		set {stats.perception} += 1
else:
	You chat about nothing in particular. Comfortable, at least.
do PatientManager.add_bea_relationship(1)
jump morning_menu/activity_choice
